{"rank": 77, "article": "Ted Lasso", "revid": 1154331705, "parentid": 1154326142, "user": "Drovethrughosts", "timestamp": "2023-05-11T19:26:47Z", "comment": "Undid revision 1154316162 by [[Special:Contributions/2600:6C5C:6A00:D62:292A:A575:3F25:C825|2600:6C5C:6A00:D62:292A:A575:3F25:C825]] ([[User talk:2600:6C5C:6A00:D62:292A:A575:3F25:C825|talk]]) per their website, it literally says, \"AppleMagazine is an independent publication and has not been authorized, sponsored, or otherwise approved by Apple Inc.\"", "tags": ["mw-undo", "wikieditor"], "size": 111674}
{"rank": 77, "article": "Ted Lasso", "revid": 1154326142, "parentid": 1154325308, "user": "MrMaster17", "timestamp": "2023-05-11T18:40:42Z", "comment": "/* Season 3 (2023) */", "tags": ["wikieditor"], "size": 111628}
{"rank": 77, "article": "Ted Lasso", "revid": 1154325308, "parentid": 1154325289, "user": "50.202.107.170", "timestamp": "2023-05-11T18:33:13Z", "comment": "/* Season 3 (2023) */", "tags": ["wikieditor"], "size": 111624}
{"rank": 77, "article": "Ted Lasso", "revid": 1154325289, "parentid": 1154316162, "user": "50.202.107.170", "timestamp": "2023-05-11T18:33:00Z", "comment": "/* Season 3 (2023) */", "tags": ["wikieditor"], "size": 111624}
{"rank": 77, "article": "Ted Lasso", "revid": 1154316162, "parentid": 1154314965, "user": "2600:6C5C:6A00:D62:292A:A575:3F25:C825", "timestamp": "2023-05-11T17:14:18Z", "comment": "/* Development */ It never says anywhere that Apple Magazine is not affiliated with Apple.  We can look at Apple Magazine and see there has to be some relationship between Apple Magazine and Apple, even if for legal reasons they may choose not to state the relationship.  For an editor here to write that it is not affiliated with Apple is a biased attempt to try to cause doubt about what the magazine says.  Such statements by editors are not objective as it is not for editors to question sources.", "tags": ["mw-reverted", "wikieditor"], "size": 111622}
