{"rank": 77, "article": "Ted Lasso", "revid": 1154040271, "parentid": 1154001200, "user": "Drmargi", "timestamp": "2023-05-09T21:33:32Z", "comment": "Undid revision 1154001200 by [[Special:Contributions/2600:6C5C:6A00:D62:8559:189B:44FF:7F23|2600:6C5C:6A00:D62:8559:189B:44FF:7F23]] ([[User talk:2600:6C5C:6A00:D62:8559:189B:44FF:7F23|talk]]) This is why we hyper-link.  If people want this level of detail, they can follow the link and read the article", "tags": ["mw-undo", "wikieditor"], "size": 110103}
{"rank": 77, "article": "Ted Lasso", "revid": 1154001200, "parentid": 1153964228, "user": "2600:6C5C:6A00:D62:8559:189B:44FF:7F23", "timestamp": "2023-05-09T16:35:13Z", "comment": "/* Development */ This edit is not unnecessary detail as it shows facts that provide insight into the exact comparison between Lasso and Terry Smith.  Smith was not just any American football coach.  He was the Great Britain national team head coach where Lasso is based.  Lasso was also an American football coach who won a national championship before coaching soccer.  Likewise, Smith won many national and European championships in Britain, including as Great Britain national team head coach.", "tags": ["mw-reverted", "wikieditor"], "size": 110764}
{"rank": 77, "article": "Ted Lasso", "revid": 1153964228, "parentid": 1153962875, "user": "Indagate", "timestamp": "2023-05-09T11:47:35Z", "comment": "/* Critical response */ update access dates for previous edit, these should be last time information found to be in the source, so if update numbers please updates the dates", "tags": ["wikieditor"], "size": 110103}
