{"rank": 77, "article": "Ted Lasso", "revid": 1149607451, "parentid": 1149607338, "user": "Drmargi", "timestamp": "2023-04-13T08:42:06Z", "comment": "Undid revision 1149607338 by [[Special:Contributions/86.11.254.125|86.11.254.125]] ([[User talk:86.11.254.125|talk]]) Irrelevant. American show, thus soccer.", "tags": ["mw-undo", "mw-reverted", "wikieditor"], "size": 104064}
{"rank": 77, "article": "Ted Lasso", "revid": 1149607338, "parentid": 1149606210, "user": "86.11.254.125", "timestamp": "2023-04-13T08:40:51Z", "comment": "Fixed error. They are playing in the UK’s football league https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/English_football_league_system\n\nThis is not called soccer outside of USA. Stop editing it to an incorrect term to appease your US bias.", "tags": ["mobile edit", "mobile web edit", "mw-manual-revert", "mw-reverted"], "size": 104066}
{"rank": 77, "article": "Ted Lasso", "revid": 1149606210, "parentid": 1149604328, "user": "Drmargi", "timestamp": "2023-04-13T08:28:46Z", "comment": "Undid revision 1149604328 by [[Special:Contributions/86.11.254.125|86.11.254.125]] ([[User talk:86.11.254.125|talk]])", "tags": ["mw-undo", "mw-reverted", "wikieditor"], "size": 104064}
{"rank": 77, "article": "Ted Lasso", "revid": 1149604328, "parentid": 1149596316, "user": "86.11.254.125", "timestamp": "2023-04-13T08:07:09Z", "comment": "Fixes incorrect term for league football (never referred to as soccer outside of USA)", "tags": ["mobile edit", "mobile web edit", "mw-manual-revert", "mw-reverted"], "size": 104066}
{"rank": 77, "article": "Ted Lasso", "revid": 1149596316, "parentid": 1149595584, "user": "Footballgy", "timestamp": "2023-04-13T06:49:12Z", "comment": "Undid revision 1149595584 by [[Special:Contributions/86.11.254.125|86.11.254.125]] ([[User talk:86.11.254.125|talk]]) all well and good, however despite the show being set and filmed in the UK featuring predominantly British actors...the show is American hence as per standard on English wikipedia the article is written in American English", "tags": ["mw-undo", "mw-reverted", "wikieditor"], "size": 104064}
{"rank": 77, "article": "Ted Lasso", "revid": 1149595584, "parentid": 1149589820, "user": "86.11.254.125", "timestamp": "2023-04-13T06:42:37Z", "comment": "The show takes place in the UK, where the sport is referred to as football, not soccer. Football is the term used internationally with the obvious exception of the USA, where the term is attributed to a game that barely sees foot touching the ball. So amended to the internationally excepted term rather than the US bias.", "tags": ["mobile edit", "mobile web edit", "mw-reverted"], "size": 104066}
{"rank": 77, "article": "Ted Lasso", "revid": 1149589820, "parentid": 1149557141, "user": "Ooligan", "timestamp": "2023-04-13T05:41:51Z", "comment": "Link", "tags": ["visualeditor"], "size": 104064}
