{"rank": 77, "article": "Ted Lasso", "revid": 1149103081, "parentid": 1149084404, "user": "Footballgy", "timestamp": "2023-04-10T06:35:59Z", "comment": "Undid revision 1149084404 by [[Special:Contributions/Joeystanley5|Joeystanley5]] ([[User talk:Joeystanley5|talk]]) not really relevant at all, its just one of many soccer documentaries. its no more notable to TL as the City one or the Juventus one. The other shows and films are all fictional shows / films surrounding a team or feature American coaches or players. Even with Kroenke as owner doesn't play a big part in the series.", "tags": ["mw-undo", "wikieditor"], "size": 103415}
